+alpha.*|fn um s:str locale="en-US"options= #{|ignore options.ignore|if ignore|if(type_of ignore)=="regex|s=s.replace ignore"<elif(type_of ignore)=="str|esc ignore.replace /[-[\]{}()*+?.,\\^$|#\\s]/g$`\$&`|s=s.replace(new RegExp"[$esc]""g")"<else|panic"ignore should be instance of a String or RegExp<<if alp.has locale|^alp[locale].test s<panic"Invalid locale '$locale'<const locales alp.keys>>list